[resource]
script = ExtResource("1_tqiy4")
username = "heresthetea"
rating = 2.0
review_content = "During my visit to cAIfe, I thought this shop looked really interesting so I decided to hop in. It was a little strange at first sight, as there didn’t really seem to be anyone working besides 1 person. After being lost for a little bit, they explained to me how to use these weird tablets to order. 

So I figured I would order a nice chai tea, and after I tapped the button, the machine immediately came to life. I thought it was so cool! Until I received a plain black tea. I was thinking, like, “what the heck!?” while the nice worker came up and told me that’s par for the course.

They pressed some buttons on their side and the machine got back to work and spat out a matcha! On the third attempt, it simply broke down! It was SO ridiculous! The worker eventually made my drink correctly themselves, but I’m wondering why they even use those sad excuses of a fountain machine. I would’ve rated 1 but put 2 stars solely for the worker being so kind.
"
customer_sprite_data_options = Array[ExtResource("2_gdbny")]([ExtResource("1_mml2q")])
